# The guard of prompt-keeps-typed.drive, for what a view or a layer holds (#269): a filter
# being typed in a list, in the table's type picker, which filters as you type, a cell
# being edited in a table, the notes marked in Tidy. Each
# answers for itself. tests/drive.rs installs the open-tasks example patched to send
# workspace/open twice and a notification whenever the tasks change. The first time, both
# requests are counted and the notification that came after them doesn't take the notice's
# place: it comes first on the line.
size 160x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 16 open tasks
keys :
type list the open
wait-for list the open tasks by note
keys enter
wait-for ↑↓ move · x tick · ⏎ open
keys /
type two per
wait-for / two per▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n
wait-for ☐ 17 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Vesuvius.md: not while a filter is being typed (2 requests refused) · so there
expect / two per▏
screen
keys esc
wait-gone two per▏
keys esc
wait-for closed the list of open tasks
keys i
wait-for Table of…
type erup
wait-for 1 of 4 rows · /erup
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n
wait-for ☐ 18 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Vesuvius.md: not while a filter is being typed
expect 1 of 4 rows · /erup
screen
keys enter
wait-for 4 rows
keys j j l e
wait-for example: [[Krakatoa]] 1883▏
keys ctrl+u
type [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
wait-for example: [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait▏
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n- [ ] Three\n
wait-for ☐ 19 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Vesuvius.md: not while a cell is being edited
expect example: [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait▏
screen
keys enter
wait-for Volcanic Explosivity Index: example set to [[Krakatoa]] 1883, Sunda Strait
keys esc
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys T
wait-for Orphans: no links in or out
keys space
wait-for Tidy · 1 marked
write Inbox/Chores.md - [ ] One\n- [ ] Two\n- [ ] Three\n- [ ] Four\n
wait-for ☐ 20 open tasks
wait-for open-tasks wanted to open Volcanoes/Vesuvius.md: not while something is marked in Tidy
expect Tidy · 1 marked
screen
keys esc
wait-gone Tidy · 1 marked
keys q
exits 0
